{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Right to Explanation.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Right to Explanation.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"right to explanation right to explanation","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Right to Explanation.md","fileName":"Right to Explanation.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Right to Explanation","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 23:09\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[AI Responsibility and Explainability]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Responsibility and Explainability","Explainable AI","Algorithmic Due Process","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Right to Explanation.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Right to Explanation.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"right to explanation right to explanation","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Right to Explanation.md","fileName":"Right to Explanation.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Right to Explanation","heading":"Right to Explanation","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"The right to explanation is a claimed entitlement to meaningful information about an automated decision that affects a person. Its purpose is to make hidden judgment contestable by showing the logic, evidence, and anticipated consequences relevant to the decision.\n\nThe scope of the right is disputed. General information about a model does not necessarily explain an individual outcome, while a full technical account may be incomprehensible. A useful right must specify who owes the explanation, what level of detail the affected person needs, and what process allows correction or appeal. It therefore links [[Explainable AI]] with [[Algorithmic Due Process]].","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Responsibility and Explainability","Explainable AI","Algorithmic Due Process","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Right to Explanation.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Right to Explanation.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"right to explanation right to explanation","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Right to Explanation.md","fileName":"Right to Explanation.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Right to Explanation","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[aiethics.epub]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Responsibility and Explainability","Explainable AI","Algorithmic Due Process","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}